      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "From my understanding, the Owner broadcast types check the ownership of the object you're referencing, rather than the object you're calling it from. So even if you have ownership over the pickup and call the Owner broadcast type from the pickup, it's checking the owner of the cube you're toggling, which happens to be the master since that is usually the default owner of everything in the instance unless ownership gets transferred otherwise. Took me a while to realize this as it threw me off at first as well...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
