      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This canny post can be removed as this is not a bug but a misunderstanding on how the Owner broadcast types work. Owner is not based on the object the trigger is on, but on the receiver's owner. All objects that do not have object sync will be \"owned\" by master.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
