  "details": "Owner, OwnerBufferOne, and OwnerUnbuffered do not behave as expected. These triggers can only be initiated by Master. \n\nExample world: wrld_42d314cf-733c-4efb-9ba3-824e1f59f0e8\n\nThis world contains a single pickup with object sync. This pickup also has a custom trigger with every broadcast type that enables a cube and turns it off after 1 second. There are 9 buttons to the right, each with a local interact calling into these custom triggers on the synced sphere. Even while someone else is holding the sphere, master is still the only one who can trigger the owner broadcast types.",
